      "content": "therapy isn't gonna fix the fact that the spark is just... gone. there's no \"path forward\" when you've reached the top and everything after this is just a slow, pathetic slide into being a nobody. i'd rather stop now while i'm still \"something\" than live to see myself become a joke.",
