      "content": "small tasks don't matter when the foundation is rotten. if you know you've peaked, isn't trying to \"reignite a flicker\" just a way of clinging to a corpse? there's a certain dignity in knowing when the story is over, rather than dragging out the sad parts until everyone's just embarrassed for you.",
